  "title": "Present perfect or past simple?",
  "language": "en",
  "feedback_mode": "at_the_end",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explanation",
      "markdown": "Use the **past simple** for a finished time: *I saw her yesterday.*\n\nUse the **present perfect** when the time is not finished or not named: *I have seen her this week. Have you ever been to Spain?*\n\nCheck your answers before you submit: nothing is marked until you do."
